### ============================================
### HIKVISION DISPOSITIVOS — REST Client
### ============================================
### Primero haz login para obtener la cookie 'token'.
### POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/login
### Content-Type: application/json
###
### {"user": "1193377218", "pass": "1193377218"}
### ============================================

### 1. LISTAR terminales con test de conexión por dispositivo
### Devuelve [{ id, name, host, port, isConnected: true|false }, ...]
### isConnected = true si la conexión al terminal es exitosa, false si no.
GET http://localhost:8000/api/hikvision/devices
Accept: application/json

### 2. TEST de conexión global (respuesta original)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/hikvision/testHikvision
Accept: application/json

### 3. LISTAR terminales — renombrar un terminal (opcional)
### Guarda/actualiza el nombre legible del terminal.
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/hikvision/devices
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "device_id": "192.168.1.64",
    "nombre": "Garita principal"
}

### 4. LISTAR terminales — verificar el nombre guardado
GET http://localhost:8000/api/hikvision/devices
Accept: application/json
